      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="85" width="420" height="80">
      <content textType="title" fontSize="28" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(240, 235, 225, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.5" letterSpacing="1">
        <p>真正的AGI，是一个</p>
        <p><span color="rgba(200, 120, 100, 1)">独立运行的认知论主体</span></p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <line startX="80" startY="185" endX="180" endY="185">
